  "title": "Easy S'Mores Bars",
  "description": "These s'mores bars have a graham cracker crust topped with a layer of gooey marshmallows and chocolate for all the flavors of s'mores in bar cookie form.",
  "authors": [
    "Darryn JoHana"
  ],
